<title>GERMANY: Dresdner Bank opens branch in Beijing.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank opens branch in Beijing.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG said on Monday it had won a licence from the People's Bank of China to open a branch in Beijing, making it the first foreign bank to pursue active banking business in the city.</p>
<p>Dresdner already has branches in Shanghai and Shenzhen and a representative office in Guangzhou, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
